\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">구걸(Begging)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_jobs_alchemy/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">포션제작자(Alchemy)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_jobs_ins/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">스크롤제작자(Inscription)</font></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>ARMS \n                            LORE  \n                            <img align=\"right\" border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/logo_arms.gif\" width=\"100\">\n</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">직업 \n                            타이틀: Warrior</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">사용시 \n                            주 상승 스탯: Strength</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">사용시 \n                            부가 상승 스탯: Dexterity</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬사용 \n                            : 해당스킬사용</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">수련 \n                            가능 NPC: Armorer, Blacksmith, Blacksmith Guildmaster, \n                            Weaponsmith, Weapons Trainer, Fighter, Warrior, \n                            Mercenary, Paladin, Merchant Guildmaster and Warrior</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬 \n                            Up: -</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/skill_index/images/point.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"15\"> \n                            장비지식은 그 유용성이 거의 없어, 사장된 스킬중의 \n                            하나입니다. 오직 제품의 상태를 보는것에 이외에</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">전투스킬 \n                            중 특수기에서 레슬링과 함께 상대방의 무기를 떨어뜨리는 \n                            디스암 </span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_sp/\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>특수기(Special \n                            Moves)</b></font></a></span><font face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">를 \n                            </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">쓸 \n                            수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana,굴림체\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/skill_index/images/point.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"15\"> \n                            장비지식</span></font></p>\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"96%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"heading\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬 구동시 장비지식 \n                                            설명</span></font></p></td>\n<td class=\"heading\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">상태</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span></font><span style=\"font-family:돋움; font-size:9pt; \nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:KO;\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">이것은 사용한 적이 없습니다</font></span><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">100 \n                                            %</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; ma