pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:KO;\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">이것은 좋은 상태입니다</font></span><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">70%</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span></font><span style=\"font-family:돋움; font-size:9pt; \nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:KO;\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">이것은 약간 닳고 헤졌습니다</font></span><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">60%</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span></font><span style=\"font-family:돋움; font-size:9pt; \nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:KO;\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">이것은 많이 닳았습니다</font></span><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">50%</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span></font><span style=\"font-family:돋움; font-size:9pt; \nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:KO;\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">이것은 조금 못쓰게 되었습니다</font></span><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">40%</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span></font><span style=\"font-family:돋움; font-size:9pt; \nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:KO;\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">이것은 조금 많이 손상을 입었습니다</font></span><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">30%</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span></font><span style=\"font-family:돋움; font-size:9pt; \nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font