an>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:돋움;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:KO;\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">-이 무기를 양손에 들고 가까운 거리에서베면 : 스워드(양손)</span>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:돋움;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:KO;\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">-이 무기를 들고 가까운 거리에서때리면 : 메이스(한손)</span>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:돋움;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:KO;\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">-이 무기를 양손에 들고 가까운 거리에서때리면 : 메이스(양손)</span>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:돋움;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:KO;\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">-이 무기를 들고 먼 거리에서 발사하면 : 활</span>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">예) \n                                            데미지 22의 석궁을 장비지식 스킬로 \n                                            알아본다면 다음과 같은 메시지가 \n                                            나옵니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이 \n                                            무기를 들고 먼거리에서 발사하기에 \n                                            아주 탁월한 무기입니다</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_skill/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/menu.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"295\">\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"#top\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/top.gif\" width=\"20\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Written By Forg</span></b></font></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_b.gif\" height=\"20\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\